we're going to be learning how to
prepare for your lab practical.

00:00:08.359 --> 00:00:11.640
So if you're watching this video,
hopefully you're a Chem 3A student.

00:00:11.965 --> 00:00:15.415
and you are trying to figure out exactly
how to prepare for your lab practical,

00:00:15.415 --> 00:00:17.245
which is probably within the next week.

00:00:17.575 --> 00:00:19.645
And you might be a little
bit stressed about it.

00:00:19.944 --> 00:00:22.125
So this is my attempt to
try to make a review video.

00:00:22.125 --> 00:00:25.605
So this is my first time really making
one for all the students of Chem 3A.

00:00:26.024 --> 00:00:30.645
Um, so if you are my student or another
student, then, um, as always, I would

00:00:30.645 --> 00:00:32.165
recommend using this video for caution.

00:00:32.165 --> 00:00:35.835
If you are my student, obviously keep
watching, but if you're another student,

00:00:36.125 --> 00:00:39.834
keep in mind that every professor does do
